This caused a brief asymmetric BGP state where router2 had not yet installed the route to 195.11.14.0/24 → exactly the "forward-works, return-fails" pattern the user described. The BGP session re-converged within one second and has been stable ever since (up/down ≈ 6 minutes, no further errors).

